{{!
    @template mod_aiknowledgecheck/learner_notice

    Tells learners which content in the activity was made by AI and who checked it (EU AI Act Article 50 and
    Article 26(11)). The data attributes are the machine-readable marker. Moodle Design System Alert (info).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * made - What AI made.
    * checked - Who checked it and when; may be empty.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "made": "The questions, answer explanations and voice narration in this activity were created with AI.",
        "checked": "Sam Taylor checked and approved them on 28/11/26."
    }
}}
<aside class="mds-alert alert alert-info kc-alert kc-ai-notice" role="note" data-ai-generated="true"
    data-ai-disclosure="eu-ai-act-art50" data-testid="notice-ai-generated">
    <i class="fa fa-wand-magic-sparkles mds-alert-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <div class="mds-alert-content">
        <strong class="mds-alert-title">{{#str}} learnernotice_title, mod_aiknowledgecheck {{/str}}</strong>
        <div class="mds-alert-body">{{made}} {{checked}} {{#str}} learnernotice_report, mod_aiknowledgecheck {{/str}}</div>
    </div>
</aside>
